#
# File: 910-mDNS-udp-dport5353-in-req-DROP.rule
# Title: Allow remote mDNS client multicast request to local mDNS server
# Description:
#    Drop IPv4 mDNS multicast traffic to 224.0.0.251:5353

ip daddr 224.0.0.251 udp dport 5353 counter drop comment "remote-to-local mDNS/UDP/5353 multicast request"
